cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, its harness, or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "GIFT MCQ Benchmark — Tier 1: a 315-item Spanish gastroenterology/hepatology MCQ evaluation of retrieval-augmented LLMs"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible evaluation of four large language models on 315 Spanish
  gastroenterology and hepatology multiple-choice items drawn from Galicia
  (SERGAS) public-employment specialist examinations, served both through the
  GIFT retrieval-augmented system and directly via OpenRouter. The package ships
  the complete raw per-call database (2,520 calls), the benchmark harness, and
  standard-library-only scripts that re-derive every published statistic.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-07-30
license: MIT
keywords:
  - large language models
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - medical question answering
  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
  - hepatology
  - gastroenterology
  - Spanish

